WEBVTT

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.250
Sherlock...

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.450
Moriarty is alive...

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.620
"I'll find you."

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.830
Is someone there?

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.830
Oh, no! We need to run!

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.160
Sherlock!

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.870
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.120
"Everybody Be There At Eight"

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.540
"Everybody Be There At Eight"
He's finally crossed the line.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.500
He's finally crossed the line.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.620
There's nothing we can do.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.790
Wait!

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:44.870
Sherlock would never murder anyone!

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.450
I'm going to believe in him
until I hear the truth myself!

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.040
Help me find him!

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.410
But...

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:54.330
I'm not smart enough to find him on my own!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.950
Sheesh... I can't believe you.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.790
Fine.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.200
Um...

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.950
Criminal files?

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.790
No. 7th prison.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.040
Escapees.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.660
"Koyoru's Funniest Stories"

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.660
"Koyoru's Funniest Stories"
This...?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.120
What's this doing here?

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:25.410
This was a gift from Sherlock.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.290
This is the police. Open up.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.250
Oh, I've been waiting.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:44.910
There was a murder in an
abandoned East Side factory.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:50.790
Sherlock Holmes' fingerprints
were found on the murder weapon.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:54.160
Is Sherlock a suspect?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.330
You don't seem very surprised.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:04:00.620
Is there a reason for that?

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.330
Sherlock would never do that!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.540
John Watson, that was your name?

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:11.410
If you want to help my brother,
cooperate with the investigation.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.370
To stop the next murder.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.500
Why won't you believe in him?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.870
He has no common sense. No ethics.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:23.950
He doesn't give a damn about anybody else.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.290
As his brother, I know that well.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.700
It wouldn't surprise me at all if he murdered--

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.450
You don't know anything!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.620
What?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:37.830
Brother, you don't know anything about him!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:45.040
You don't have the right to call me that.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.700
Mycroft- <i>san</i> !

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.370
I'm leaving.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.870
So, is there anything you know?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.120
Nothing.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:05.410
Well, if you remember something, contact me.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.500
"7th Prison Escapee"

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.330
Where is he?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.450
What are you talking about?

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.120
Moriarty!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.500
Sherlock wouldn't kill someone.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.830
There must be something we're missing.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:59.540
But Sherlock's been acting
weird since Christmas.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:04.120
Sherlock is convinced Moriarty's alive.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:09.080
He may have fallen for a trap Moriarty left.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.200
Let's all go find him!

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:13.410
If we all split up and--

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.910
Why are you getting us involved?

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:22.080
Why? Because Sherlock's one of us, right?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.790
"One of us," huh?

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.620
John, I might do something to help you.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:31.620
But he's nothing but a business
rival to me. Never has been.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.250
Oh, yeah?

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.540
Then here!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.040
Take this and this!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.790
This is an S-Rank job, with bonus!

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:42.000
Your job: bring back Sherlock!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.660
You don't have a problem now, huh?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:51.040
It's up to us whether we take the job or not.

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.080
I'm passing.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.700
Me, too.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:58.750
Why?

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.950
I don't want to get involved,
to tell you the truth.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.040
You'll take the job, right, Kobayashi- <i>san</i> ?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.910
Does anything get better if I bring him back?

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:19.290
I'm sick of all this weird shit.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.540
Mary- <i>san</i> ?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.700
This is a problem of the heart.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.700
What does that mean?

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:33.000
We've always looked out for each other, right?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.040
You can't do this!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.410
You really are dumb!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.750
Sherlock killed him!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.540
Because of him!

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.040
You mean Moriarty?

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:46.250
You get it, right?

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.540
You know what he did!

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:51.080
But Sherlock is...

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:55.500
I don't want to get involved
with anything he's a part of!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.250
Watson.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.790
Sherlock did it again...

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.160
No!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:13.790
I want to believe it isn't true, too...

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.330
Watson?

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.610
"Watson" "I'm begging you.
I need your help, Mary- <i>san</i> ."

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.820
"Please help me!
I need you, Michel- <i>san</i> !"

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.910
"Kyogoku- <i>san</i> . I'm sorry to keep asking.
Please help me."

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.660
You're getting annoying.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.500
Texts didn't work so now
you've moved on to ambushes?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.160
It's for Sherlock!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:55.000
Why are you doing all this for Sherlock?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.040
He's a weirdo!

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.540
Sure, all that ever comes out
of his mouth is either <i>rakugo</i> ,

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.370
mystery-solving, or an insult.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:08.910
No matter what you do for him,
he never says thanks.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.580
He's a jerk, but...

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:15.660
That weirdo is still my friend! He changed me!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.790
What?

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:19.540
If you hate him, fine!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:22.450
Don't do it for Sherlock!

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.660
Save him for me!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:28.870
I need everyone... I need you!

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.290
Get lost.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:49.080
I asked Kaneko Financial to help out
and Dylan's friends, who are catches, too.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.950
But nobody could find anything on Sherlock.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:55.120
Irene has no update either.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:03.830
This'll get you rock hard, so...

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:07.080
Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:12.700
They haven't found James' body, right?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:17.330
When I hear that Sherlock's
looking for him so frantically,

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:21.040
it starts to feel like he might really be alive.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.500
"King Kong Drink"

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.040
Are you serious?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:33.660
Yeah. The light turns on
in that mansion at night.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.290
Maybe the captain's--

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.290
Stop it!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:40.540
Forget about him.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.330
Moriarty...

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.810
"No interviews."

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.500
It's turned off?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.790
Hello?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.480
"I'll find you."
"Skywalk. Now."

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.230
"Skywalk. Now."

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.580
I'm sorry! It's not what it looks like...

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.040
I mean, I apologize for trespassing...

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.910
I heard Moriarty was here...

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.200
You know Master James?

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.410
So you were the Moran family's maid?

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.700
Yes.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.450
After what happened with the master,

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:32.830
the rest of the family said they wanted
nothing to do with the place,

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:36.410
so I've been handling things at the mansion.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.370
I see.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.620
Mister.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.160
Send that to me later, okay?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.910
When you ask people
for something, you need to--

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.870
Right. Please.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.450
Dummy.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:10.080
Um, so you're searching for the master?

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:16.250
More specifically, I'm searching for
my friend, who believes he's alive.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:19.500
I thought he might be here.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.620
I'm afraid he isn't...

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.540
"John H Watson started a group chat."

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.000
This is John Watson.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:40.080
It's possible that I was refusing
to think about Moriarty...

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:43.700
He hurt many people. Caused much sadness.

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.870
Betrayed us.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:51.540
But I don't hate him. I can't.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:54.580
Because he's my friend.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.580
He's a normal high school student.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:59.660
Smart. A brat.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:03.700
That's the real Moriarty to me.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:11.160
All that's left now is my wish
that I could've saved him.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:14.450
I wonder if there's something else I could do.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.750
I don't know what, but...

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:21.410
P.S. This is my last message.

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.700
I'm sorry for sending so many texts.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.120
Sherlock!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.500
P.P.S.: I found him! He's heading to city hall!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.200
Help me!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:09.620
Moriarty!

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.040
Where are you?

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.370
Why?

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:32.620
Your "assistant" was carrying this.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:35.370
This belonged to Moriarty.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:42.290
I used it.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:47.410
Criminal files?

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:49.620
No. 7th prison.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:53.500
You couldn't see through a trap like this?

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.500
"Shinjuku East Side Police
Evidence"

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.790
That's not like you, Sherlock.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.180
"I'll find you."
"Skywalk. Now."

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.600
"Skywalk. Now."

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:08.160
Now come here!

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.700
Yes. Just like that.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:21.290
Sherlock!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.580
Oww!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.450
Wait! Don't shoot!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.000
What are you doing?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.080
This is for your sake!

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.330
Shut up!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:34.950
We have an emergency situation.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.540
Mycroft- <i>san</i> 's been taken hostage.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.950
Come immediately to...

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.580
Hey, you!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.950
What are you doing? Stop!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:50.540
Sherlock, Moriarty's gone.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.370
You saw it!

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:57.750
He can't have survived a fall from this height!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.580
Why don't you understand that?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.500
The last escapee is still out there.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.660
If I can catch him, I can get to him!

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:10.830
Sherlock, wake up!

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:13.160
Moriarty isn't dead!

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.330
Stop it, Sherlock!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.410
Don't get in my way!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.500
No!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.200
Damn it! Don't get in my way!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.540
I have to destroy Sherlock, too.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.370
Once you kill someone...

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:53.250
You don't have a heart of your own.

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.450
You can be the real Sherlock Holmes.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.370
It's not me who's killing me right now.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.950
It's you.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:03.830
Come with me, Sherlock.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.950
Sherlock Holmes.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.410
Don't worry.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:29.040
I won't let you end up like Moriarty.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.080
"Koyoru's Funniest Stories"

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.450
Believe in me.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:46.660
You're such a moron.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:54.450
I found this in your room.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:02.080
I can't believe he came
to bring it back, can you?

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:10.450
I looked it up. That's not a clover,
it's a wood sorrel.

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:14.330
In the language of flowers,
it means "joy," and "a shining heart."

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:17.040
Moriarty was always picking these.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:20.950
Maybe he was in search of a bright hope.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.750
We're leaving.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.410
How?

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.200
Those are Moriarty's drones!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.450
They're going to explode!

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.500
Retreat! Retreat!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.200
Hey, stay in position!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.410
Retreat!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:39.830
They're going to explode!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.830
Is that Kobayashi- <i>san</i> ?

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.370
Let's go.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.540
My hair!

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.330
"I'm heading to Moran's mansion.
It's supposed to be empty but I think
someone's there. Maybe it's Sherlock!"

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.750
Your helper's here!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.870
Come to the elevator!

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:07.580
Going down!

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:10.250
Thank you, Michel- <i>san</i> !

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:19.750
Hey there, evening, everybody.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.790
Huh? Isn't this the elevator?

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:25.200
Oh? Were you waiting for someone?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:33.370
I don't know why you think it's okay
to drag me out of the hospital to drive.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.000
You're almost better, right?

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:42.040
Next they have a car out back, they say!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.330
Stop right there!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.080
Surrender!

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.200
Crap!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:07.290
What the heck?

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.290
What? I can't see!

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.080
Now go!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.160
Irene- <i>san</i> !

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.200
Thanks!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.910
I'll pay you back for this.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.120
As long as it's not in <i>rakugo</i> merchandise.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:18.870
Bye, Sherlock!

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.160
What's going on?

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.580
What's the situation?

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.910
He fled on the motorcycle! After him!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:40.250
Um, not so hard...

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.250
No whining.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:47.040
You came, Mary- <i>san</i> .

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.160
You hired me, right?

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.870
Oh, uh, yeah.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:57.410
We just wondered if there was
something we could've done.

00:21:57.410 --> 00:21:59.200
Mary- <i>san</i> ...

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:01.700
Okay, all done!

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:03.750
Oww!

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.160
So, what now?

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:09.120
Head to Kabukicho.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
"See you in Kabukicho!"

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.070
"Wood Sorrel (Oxalis corniculata)" "A perennial herb
in the Oxalis family, with heart-shaped flowers."
"At night, fold the flower in the middle. It will look
like half the flower disappeared." "See you next week!"
